 e sun goes down. Grab a flashlight and get ready to see (and hear!) the Pa
 rk in a whole new light. Date: November 24th Time: 5:30–6:30 PM Location
 : Meet at the Veterans Memorial\, Moncus Park Led by: Chris Adams\, Moncus
  Park Conservation Team Sponsored by: MJ Sindler Family Fund for Culture &
